## Dockerfile (多阶段构建)

```dockerfile
FROM node:22-alpine AS base
FROM base AS deps       # 依赖安装
FROM base AS builder    # 构建 (webpack standalone)
FROM base AS runner     # 运行 (非root, nextjs:nodejs)
```

## docker-compose.yml

```yaml
services:
  portal:
    build: .
    ports: "3200:3000"
    restart: unless-stopped
    healthcheck: wget spider http://localhost:3000/
```

```bash
docker-compose up -d    # 启动 → http://localhost:3200
```

